<title>JORDAN: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>JORDAN </p>
<p>GOVERNMENT LIST (970805)</p>
<p>*************************************************************</p>
<p>*  4 Nov 97 - Parliamentary elections.			    *</p>
<p>*************************************************************</p>
<p>Head of State......King HUSSEIN</p>
<p>Crown Prince (Acting Regent in the King's absence, special</p>
<p>responsibility for economic Development).....Prince HASSAN</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 19 Mar 97)</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Apptd 19 Mar 97)........Abdul-Salam al-MAJALI</p>
<p> (Also Minister of Defence)</p>
